The [[Divine Potion]] is a godly [[Potion]] available in the shop for all classes. When the player has enough debuffs, the [[Divine Potion]] will consume and cleanse a significant number of them.

Like all [[Potion]]s, when used, it will apply the affect of the [[Potion]] above it, without consuming the one above. This adjacency is unlike most in that the {{icon/star}} will always be placed above the [[Potion]], rather than rotating along with the item.

Combining a [[Divine Potion]] with a [[Leather Boots]] crafts the [[Winged Boots]], which have the power to dodge a few attacks outright.
